    },
    {
      "displayText": "Do you know about Skarmory, the Armor Bird\nPokémon?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F00200079006F00750020006B006E006F0077002000610062006F0075007400200053006B00610072006D006F00720079002C0020007400680065002000410072006D006F007200200042006900720064000A0050006F006B00E9006D006F006E003F001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It sheds thin, sharp feathers that were once used\nto make swords. Today, they’re used for knives.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ve been wanting to get my hands on one of\nthose feathers so I can gift it to a top-class chef<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nwho’s near and dear to my heart.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 136
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And a Z-A Royale Trainer such as yourself seems\nlike the perfect person to find one for me!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Problem is, the Skarmory in Lumiose are found in\nWild Zone 17. And that zone is just bursting with<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nferocious Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 125
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s why I’m outsourcing the whole search to a\nTrainer of your talent... Thanks in advance!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please find me a Skarmory feather! I suggest\nlooking in Wild Zone 17.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C0065006100730065002000660069006E00640020006D00650020006100200053006B00610072006D006F007200790020006600650061007400680065007200210020004900200073007500670067006500730074000A006C006F006F006B0069006E006700200069006E002000570069006C00640020005A006F006E0065002000310037002E001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
