      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490074201900730020006100200067006C00690074007400650072007900200062006500610064002E002E002E00200054006F006F002000620061006400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s a piece of sparkly sequin... Too bad!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049007420190073002000610020007000690065006300650020006F006600200073007000610072006B006C0079002000730065007100750069006E002E002E002E00200054006F006F002000620061006400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I got the feeling you might’ve found a feather by\nnow, so I bolted past the Pyroar to get up here!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nThat’s the feather, right? Ooh, I can already tell\nit’ll make an incredible kitchen knife!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 197
    },
    {
      "displayText": "SKARAAA!!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053004B004100520041004100410021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wh-why now?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570068002D0077006800790020006E006F0077003F0021001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Please! You need to scare off this Skarmory!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3160,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006C0065006100730065002100200059006F00750020006E00650065006400200074006F0020007300630061007200650020006F006600660020007400680069007300200053006B00610072006D006F007200790021001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "SKARAAA!!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053004B004100520041004100410021002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Phew... Why in the world would this Skarmory\nattack us like that?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006800650077002E002E002E002000570068007900200069006E002000740068006500200077006F0072006C006400200077006F0075006C00640020007400680069007300200053006B00610072006D006F00720079000A00610074007400610063006B0020007500730020006C0069006B006500200074006800610074003F001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "SKARAAA!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053004B0041005200410041004100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Are you angry because...this feather is important\nto you? Well, it is to me too, you know!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "There’s a chef I want to give it to so he can make\nit into an amazing kitchen knife...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The food he cooks brings real joy to the good folks\nof Lumiose—and to the Pokémon too!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nHe’s a very special chef, so...please! Will you let\nme have this feather?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 168
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Skar!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006B0061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You...you’re OK with me having it?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F0075002E002E002E0079006F00752019007200650020004F004B002000770069007400680020006D006500200068006100760069006E0067002000690074003F0021001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Skar!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006B0061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you so much for your help! I’ll tell the chef\nall about you and your kindness!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh! And once he starts cooking meals with his\nnew knife, you’re very welcome to pay us a visit<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nat Restaurant Le Wow!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 124
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Skar!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006B0061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I sure hope my feelings reached this Skarmory...\nDo you think it really understood me?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Yeah, it seems you got through to it",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006500610068002C0020006900740020007300650065006D007300200079006F007500200067006F00740020007400680072006F00750067006800200074006F0020006900740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I bet it’ll show up at your restaurant",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200062006500740020006900742019006C006C002000730068006F007700200075007000200061007400200079006F00750072002000720065007300740061007500720061006E00740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I suppose so! Now that I’ve made friends with a\nwild Pokémon, who knows what’ll happen next!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
